  {
    "speaker": "監督",
    "text": "なんでも好きなもの頼んでください\r\nあ、僕はブレンドコーヒーで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "私も同じもので……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017011010040,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "『夕やけオレンジソーダ』がいっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201701101/2017011010040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "あー……すみません、それは予約の方のみでして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017011010050,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "えー！\r\nなんでっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701101/2017011010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "えっと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "準備に時間がかかるんじゃないかな？\r\n材料に限りがあるとか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017011010060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ふーん？\r\nじゃあ、『気まぐれレモネード』にするっす",
    "charAnim1": "surp4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701101/2017011010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017011010070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "それと、『昔ながらのプリン』！\r\n──これって、何が昔なんすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701101/2017011010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "な、何がと言うと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たぶん、とろっとしてなくて\r\n固めなんじゃないか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "監督",
    "text": "ここのプリン美味しいんですよ\r\nカラメル苦めで、生クリームとサクランボついてます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017011010080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "生クリーム！\r\nじゃあ、これにするっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701101/2017011010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "は、はい\r\nかしこまりました",
